<title>GERMANY: MAN unit ups stake in DSD Dillinger.</title>
<headline>MAN unit ups stake in DSD Dillinger.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAN AG unit Ferrostall AG plans to increase its stake in industrial firm DSD Dillinger Stahlbau GmbH to 100 percent, MAN said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Ferrostall already owns a 38.1 percent share of DSD Dillinger.</p>
<p>The MAN unit plans to increase its share in DSD by purchasing a 25.2 percent stake from fund management group Welsch, a 30 percent share from a second fund management company, Atlas, and a 6.7 percent stake that is held by a DSD unit.</p>
<p>MAN said supervisory authorities must still approve the proposed deal.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
